adjudication.rationale:
In the new method CredentialHelper.createRecoveryCodesCredential, JSON serialization of generatedCodes is wrapped in a try/catch and any IOException is rethrown as `new RuntimeException(e)` with no message/context (user/realm/operation):
```java
try {
  recoveryCodesJson = JsonSerialization.writeValueAsString(generatedCodes);
} catch (IOException e) {
  throw new RuntimeException(e);
}
```
This is a real, diff-grounded issue impacting diagnosability/observability, but it does not by itself prove broken behavior or correctness defect in normal operation.
